\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2166839 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Part II 
\hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  The Price of Freedom
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 
\par 
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 1: The Colosseum
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The roar of the crowd shook the stone walls.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stood in the center of the arena, his sword hanging loosely at his side. Sweat \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
dripped from his brow, and his breathing was heavy, but his eyes remained fixed on the three warriors approaching him from the opposite gate.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Beyond them, thousands of spectators waited eagerly for bloodshed.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The announcer's voice boomed across the arena.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Another challenger approaches the final bout of the day! A nameless swordsman dragged from the depths of Hollow Cave! A man who has already survived the impossible!"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The crowd erupted.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Will he fall here, like so many before him? Or will this foreigner prove himself worthy of the second rank?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji rolled his shoulders and tightened his grip.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Second rank.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 That was all that stood between him and freedom.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
The first warrior charged with a heavy axe. Kenji sidestepped, caught the man's weapon against his blade, and drove an elbow into his opponent's jaw. Before the warrior could recover, Kenji swept his legs out from under him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The second came from behind.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji ducked beneath a wild swing and drove the pommel of his sword into the attacker's ribs.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The third hesitated.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 That hesitation cost him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 A single flash of steel ended the fight.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 For a moment, the arena was silent.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Then the crowd exploded.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "INCREDIBLE! THE OUTLANDER HAS DONE IT!"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji lowered his sword.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Another victory. Another step toward freedom.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 And yet, as the cheers washed over him, he felt no pride.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Only exhaustion.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He had fought monsters in the Whispering Woods. He had faced an ancient horror beneath an island. He had survived things that should have killed him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 But here, people cheered as if his suffering were entertainment.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Just a little longer,}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506  he told himself.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Then I'll find Miya. Then I'll figure out who I am.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 2: Rank Two
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The days that followed blurred together.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Every morning, Kenji was dragged from his cel\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 l and sent into the arena. Every evening, he returned covered in bruises, his sword stained with the blood of beasts and men alike.

\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Some opponents were criminals. Others were mercenaries. A few wore armor bearing the insignia of distant kingdoms.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Some fought for glory.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Others fought for survival.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji fought for his freedom.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He learned the Colosseum's rhythms quickly. He watched his opponents before striking. He conserved his strength. He never wasted a movement.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 His victories began to unsettle the overseers.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Vex, who had once mocked him through the bars of his cell, stopped laughing.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 On the morning of his final match, the overseer appeared outside Kenji's cell.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Get up, swordsman."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji rose slowly.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Another fight?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Vex gave him a thin smile.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Your last one, if you don't make a fool of yourself."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And if I win?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Rank Two. Your debt is paid. Your freedom is granted."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji studied the man's face.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "You sound disappointed."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Vex's smile vanished.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Careful. Men who think too highly of themselves tend not to last long around here."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji walked past him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then I suppose I'll have to disappoint you."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The final bout was brutal.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
His opponent was a towering champion known as Ghoran the Breaker, a veteran gladiator who wielded a massive iron hammer. Every blow cratered the arena floor. Kenji was forced to rely on speed and precision, slipping past attacks that would have crushed hi
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 s bones.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 When Ghoran finally overextended himself, Kenji struck.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Once.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Twice.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 A third time.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The champion fell to one knee.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji placed his sword against Ghoran's throat.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Yield."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 For several seconds, the arena held its breath.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Then Ghoran dropped his hammer.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I yield."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The announcer's voice thundered through the Colosseum.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "THE VICTOR! THE FIRST CHALLENGER IN RECORDED HISTORY TO CLAIM THE SECOND RANK!"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The crowd roared.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stepped back, lowering his blade.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 For the first time since arriving at the Colosseum, he allowed himself to smile.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Freedom.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He could almost feel it.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 3: A Promise Made of Lies
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Vex met Kenji at the arena exit.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Well done," the overseer said. "You've earned your reward."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then let me go."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Of course. The formal ceremony will take place tomorrow morning. Until then, you'll be given a private room and a decent meal."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji narrowed his eyes.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Why wait until morning?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Procedure."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Since when did you care about procedure?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Vex's expression hardened, but he quickly recovered.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Enjoy your final night, swordsman. You've earned it."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Two guards escorted Kenji to a small chamber away from the common cells. It was hardly luxurious, but it had a proper bed, clean water, and a meal that didn't resemble scraps.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 For the first time in days, Kenji could sleep without the sound of chains rattling nearby.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Yet something about Vex's behavior troubled him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The overseer hadn't looked like a man who had lost a valuable prisoner.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He'd looked like a man waiting for something to happen.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji sat on the edge of the bed and examined the old scars across his hands.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Tomorrow," he whispered.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Tomorrow, I'll find you, Miya."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He lay down and eventually drifted into an uneasy sleep.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He never heard the lock turn.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 4: The Stranger in the Dark
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Wake up."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji's eyes snapped open.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 A figure stood near the foot of his bed, cloaked in dark traveling clothes. One hand rested against the wall, while the other held a small device glowing with faint blue light.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji reached for his sword.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Don't," \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 the stranger whispered. "Unless you want every guard in this place knocking down the door."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Who are you?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Someone who's about to save your life."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji rose, putting himself between the stranger and the door.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's a bold claim for someone who just broke into my room."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Fair enough."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The stranger lowered his hood.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He looked young, perhaps a little older than Kenji, with sharp eyes and a faint scar running along his jaw. His expression was calm, but his gaze kept flicking toward the door.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "My name is \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Never heard of you."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That makes two of us, probably. Now, listen carefully. You need to leave this place. Immediately."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji frowned.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I'm being released in the morning."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "No, you're not."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Vex said\hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 "
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Vex lies."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook stepped closer.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "There's no freedom ceremony. There's no reward. Rank Two isn't an achievement here, Kenji. It's a death sentence."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji's hand tightened around his sword.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Explain."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I don't have time."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then make time."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook stared at him for a moment before letting out a \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 frustrated sigh.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Fine. The Colosseum isn't an arena. It's a farm."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "A farm?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "A farm for souls."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The words hung in the air.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stared at him, waiting for the punchline.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 There wasn't one.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook continued.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Every battle, every death, every desperate struggle for survival feeds something. Something that exists beyond this world. The people who run the Colosseum have been collecting souls for a very long time."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji shook his head.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "You're telling me this entire place exists to kill people?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Not everyone. \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Only the ones who are useful."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And what makes Rank Two different?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Nobody has ever reached it before you."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji's stomach tightened.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "What happens when they do?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook's silence answered him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji drew his sword halfway from its sheath.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Where's Miya?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook's expression changed.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 For the first time, his composure cracked.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "She's alive."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji exhaled.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Where?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "At my outpost. She's safe."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stepped toward him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "You said she was in the infirmary."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I said she's alive. I never said she was in the \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 infirmary."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then tell me where she is."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook hesitated.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "She was never taken there. After the battle in Hollow Cave, the guards left her behind. They thought she was dead."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji felt the room tilt.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He remembered the Drowned Sovereign. The guards being thrown aside. The final strike. The darkness that followed.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He remembered nothing after that.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "They abandoned her?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Yes. We found her before the cave was sealed. She's been recovering at our outpost."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji's hand trembled around his sword.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He had been \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 fighting for his freedom, believing Miya was somewhere within reach.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 All the while, she had been left to die.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Take me to her."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Gladly. But we have to move now. If the people behind this discover that you've reached Rank Two, they'll come for you."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Let them."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's exactly the kind of thing that gets people killed."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji glared at him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook didn't flinch.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Look, I understand. You want answers. You want your friend. You want to know who you were before you lost your memory."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji froze.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "What did you \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 say?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I know you're a mercenary with no recollection of your past. I know you've been searching for answers. And I know that whatever brought you here, it wasn't an accident."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji drew his blade completely.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "How do you know that?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook glanced at the door.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Because I think you may be the one thing the people running this place didn't account for."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He raised the glowing device in his hand.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Blue light spilled across the floor, forming a circle of intricate symbols.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The air began to ripple.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stared at \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 the forming portal.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "What is that?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Our way out."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And where does it lead?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Somewhere the Colosseum can't reach us."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook extended his free hand.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Come with me, Kenji. I'll explain everything. But if we stay here, there may not be anything left to explain."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji looked toward the door.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He had come to this island searching for purpose. He had entered the Colosseum seeking glory, only to discover that his life meant nothing to the people who controlled it.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Now someone was offering him a way out.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He didn't \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 trust Rook.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 But he trusted the Colosseum even less.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji sheathed his sword and stepped into the portal.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Take me to Miya."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook gave a faint smile.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's the spirit."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The light swallowed them both.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 And somewhere deep within the Colosseum, an alarm began to sound.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Chapter 2: Beyond the Veil
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 1: The Outpost
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji s\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 tumbled out of the portal and nearly fell to his knees.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The air was different here.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Cooler. Thinner. Carrying the scent of pine and damp earth rather than salt and blood.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He caught himself against a wooden railing and looked up.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
An enormous mountain range stretched across the horizon, its peaks piercing a violet sky. Floating fragments of stone drifted between the mountains, connected by bridges of shimmering light. Far below, rivers of luminous blue water wound through forests t
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 hat seemed to glow from within.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji had never seen anything like it.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Where are we?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Home," Rook replied.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That doesn't answer my question."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "No, but it's a start."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
The outpost was built into the side of a mountain, its wooden buildings connected by narrow walkways. Strange machinery hummed beneath the floorboards. People moved through the settlement carrying weapons, supplies, and devices Kenji couldn't begin to ide
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 ntify.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Some wore armor.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Others wore robes embroidered with symbols.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 A few didn't look entirely human.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji reached for his sword.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook noticed.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Relax. Most of them won't bite."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Most?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "You're going to fit right in."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Before Kenji could demand another answer, a familiar voice called out from across the courtyard.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Kenji?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He turned.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Miya stood beneath a wooden awning, leaning on a staff. She looked pale and exhausted, with bandages wrapped around one arm, but she was alive.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 For a moment, neither of them moved.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Then Kenji crossed the courtyard in three long strides.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Miya!"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 She barely had time to smile before he pulled her into a hug.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "You're alive," he said, his voice breaking slightly. "I thought\hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 "
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I know."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 She held him tightly.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I thought I'd never see you again."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stepped back and examined her injuries.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "How bad was it?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Bad enough."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "You should have been in the infirmary."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Miya's smile faded.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Kenji... I wasn't taken to the infirmary."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I know. Rook told me."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 She looked toward the man standing behind him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then I suppose it's time he told you the rest."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook folded his arms.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's why I brought you here."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Miya glanced at Kenji.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "There's a lot you need to know. And you're probably not going to like any of it."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji looked between them.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then stop talking around it and tell me."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook nodded toward a building at the far end of the outpost.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Come on. There's a room where we can talk without half the settlement listening in."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He started walking.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Welcome to the real world, Kenji."
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 2: The Soul Farm
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The room Rook led them to was filled with maps, books, and strange devices that pulsed with pale light.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 At its center stood a circular table displaying a three-dimensional projection of the Colosseum.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stopped in front of it.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "What is this?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "A reconstruction of the facility. We've been watching it for years."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook touched the table.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The projection changed, revealing countless luminous threads stretching from the arena into a vast, dark structure suspended beyond it.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stared.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "What are those?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Soul pathways."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook enlarged the image.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"Every living being possesses an essence. Call it a soul, a spirit, or whatever makes sense to you. When someone dies, that essence normally returns to the natural cycle of existence. But the Colosseum interrupts that process."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He traced one of the glowing threads.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "The battles generate enormous quantities of spiritual energy. The deaths make that energy easier to collect. The people behind the Colosseum harvest what's left and send it somewhere else."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Somewhere else where?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "We don't know."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then how do you know any of this is true?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Miya answered before Rook could.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Because I saw it."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji turned toward her.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "After the Sovereign fell, I regained consciousness for a few moments. The guards were searching the chamber. They weren't looking for survivors. They were collecting something from the bodies."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 She looked down at her bandaged arm.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I tried to move, but I couldn't. One of them checked my pulse and said I wasn't worth the trouble. They left me in the cave."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji's jaw tightened.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Who are these people?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's what we've been trying to find out," Rook said. "We know the Colosseum is connected to something much larger. We know its operators answer to someone\hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 or something\hich\f31506 
\emdash \loch\f31506 outside the world where it stands."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He dismissed the projection.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "But we don't know who gives the orders. Not yet."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji looked at the empty space where the Colosseum had been.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And Rank Two?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook's expression grew serious.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That was never meant to be a rank. It was a threshold."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "A threshold to what?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "We don't know. But the moment you reached it, the system reacted. Every monitoring device we have registered an enormous surge of energy."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Miya frowned.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Why would Kenji trigger something like that?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's the question."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook leaned against the table.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Thousands of people have fought in that arena. Champions,\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506  warriors, monsters, even beings that weren't native to that world. None of them reached Rank Two."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He paused.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then you arrived, and everything changed."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji felt a familiar frustration rising in his chest.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He had spent so long searching for his past that he had almost forgotten how it felt to be told there was something unusual about him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 But unusual wasn't the same as special.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Maybe I'm just a better swordsman."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Maybe," Rook replied. "But I don't believe in coincidences. Not when the fate of entire worlds may be involved."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji looked at Miya.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And you believe him?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 She considered the question.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I believe he saved my life. I believe the Colosseum is hiding something. And I believe we need answers."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 She met Kenji's gaze.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "But I don't think we should trust anyone blindly. Not even Rook."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook raised both hands.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Fair enough."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji sighed.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "All right. What do you want from me?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook's expression became almost solemn.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "To help me understand why you were able to do what nobody else could."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And in return?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I'll help you find out who you are."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 For the first time, Kenji had a reason to listen.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He had come to Paradise Island searching for meaning. He had fought his way through the Colosseum for freedom.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Now he was being offered something far more dangerous.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The truth.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 3: A Universe of Worlds
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook led them outside.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 At the edge of the outpost stood a stone platform overlooking the valley. Several metallic rings rotated slowly above its center, each inscribed with symbols that shifted when Kenji tried to read them.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Before we go any further," Rook said, "there's something you need to understand."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji folded his arms.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Another secret?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "An explanation. There's a difference."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook gestured toward the sky.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Look at those mountains. What do you see?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Mountains."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Look beyond them."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji did.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 At first, he noticed the floating stones. Then the strange stars visible even in daylight. Finally, he saw something that made his breath catch.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Far beyond the mountains, suspended against the sky, was a second horizon.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 A landscape hung upside down above the clouds.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Forests grew from its underside. Rivers flowed upward into the heavens. And in the distance, an enormous structure resembling a shattered moon circled a glowing sphere.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stared.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "What am I looking at?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Another world."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's impossible."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Only if you assume the world you know is the only one that exists."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook touched one of the rings. A series of lights ignited.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"Your world, the Colosseum, this outpost, and countless others exist across a network of dimensions. Each dimension contains its own worlds, histories, and civilizations. Some are connected naturally. Others are separated by barriers so strong that crossi
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 ng them should be impossible."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He pointed toward the upside-down landscape.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"Some dimensions follow familiar rules. Others don't. Time may flow differently. Magic may function in ways that would be unthinkable where you came from. There are places where the dead walk, where stars are born beneath the earth, and where entire civil
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 izations exist inside the dreams of sleeping gods."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji looked at the rotating rings.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And you can travel between them?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "With the right knowledge. The right tools. And sometimes, the right person."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji glanced at Miya.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "How long have you known about all this?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Not long enough," Rook answered for her.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He turned toward a narrow passage leading deeper into the mountain.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "There are records that predate every known civilization. Records of the first world, the first being, and the event that made all others possible."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 He looked directly at Kenji.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "They're kept in a place called the Vault."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "The Vault?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "It's the oldest repository of knowledge we've ever discovered. If the answers exist anywhere, they're there."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji hesitated.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "And why do you think it will answer my questions?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Because the entrance has been waiting for you."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji stared at him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "How could a door possibly be waiting for me?"
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook smiled faintly.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "That's what we're going to find out."
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Chapter 3: The Vault of Origins
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Scene 1: The Living Door
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2166839\charrsid2166839 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The Vault lay beneath the outpost, beyond a series of chambers that seemed older than the mountain itself.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The walls were smooth black stone, unmarked by tools or weathering. Lines of silver light ran through the floor, illuminating \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
symbols that shifted whenever Kenji looked directly at them.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Miya walked close beside him.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I don't like this place," she murmured.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Neither do I."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Good. I was worried you'd started enjoying mysterious underground places."
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Kenji almost laughed.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Almost.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Rook led them through a final archway.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Beyond it stood an enormous door.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 It had no hinges, handles, or visible locking mechanism. Its surface resembled polished obsidian, but beneath it moved a faint constellation of lights, as if the night sky had been 
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 trapped inside the stone.
